# PLOS ONE submission DOCX: a build artifact of
# docs/submission/plosone/build_manuscript_docx.py, regenerated on demand.
# A DOCX carries creation timestamps, so it cannot be pinned to a stable hash.
docs/submission/plosone/*.docx

# Internal-review PDF: a build artifact of
# docs/submission/plosone/build_review_pdf.py, regenerated on demand. It is a
# third rendering of manuscript_combined.txt plus the five figure PDFs, all of
# which are tracked, and no gate reads it, so it went stale unnoticed. The
# pattern is anchored here and does not reach the figure PDFs one level down.
docs/submission/plosone/*.pdf
